msgstr "Open a page"

msgid "恢复默认"
msgstr "Restore defaults"

msgid "请按键"
msgstr "Press a key"

msgid "%s\n%s 集中约 %d%%"
msgstr "%s\n%s · About %d%% of arrivals"

msgid "返回日报"
msgstr "Back to report"

msgid "营业复盘"
msgstr "Service report"

msgid "章节胜利"
msgstr "Chapter won"

msgid "房租不足"
msgstr "Could not pay rent"

msgid "第 %d 天 · %s"
msgstr "Day %d · %s"

msgid "夜晚准备"
msgstr "Night planning"

msgid "重新开始本章？"
msgstr "Restart this chapter?"

msgid "会替换当前检查点。旧版本档案在首次覆盖前会留作备份。"
msgstr "This replaces the current checkpoint. The previous save is backed up before the first overwrite."

msgid "可选：输入整数种子复现同一局"
msgstr "Optional: enter an integer seed to replay the same run"

msgid "确认重新开局"
msgstr "Confirm restart"

msgid "取消"
msgstr "Cancel"

msgid "新开局"
msgstr "New run"

msgid "请直接按一个键。"
msgstr "Press a single key."

msgid "阿禾 · 前厅"
msgstr "He · Front of house"

msgid "夜晚用左键按住一张餐桌，等它抬起后拖到同规格的桌上，再松手。两张单人桌合成双人桌，两张双人桌合成四人桌。"
msgstr "At night, hold a table until it lifts, drag it onto a matching table, then release. Two singles make a two-seat table. Two doubles make a four-seat table."

msgid "重大事件预告会出现在前一份日报的「明日预告」。公告按钮会在事件生效期间的夜晚出现。点右上角红色的「重大事件」，查看生效日期、客流变化和限时任务。带奖励的公告会显示「确定并领取」。"
msgstr "Check Tomorrow's Forecast in the previous report. During the event, open the red Major Event button at night to see dates, guest traffic, and timed goals. Choose Confirm & Claim if there is a reward."

msgid "21:00 停止接待新客，00:00 解散店外队伍。店内客人会继续点餐、用餐和结账。最后一位客人离开后才出日报。"
msgstr "New guests stop arriving at 21:00. The queue leaves at midnight. Seated guests still order, eat, and pay. The report opens when the last guest leaves."

msgid "客人选好菜后还在等点单。点「在餐厅定位」，看看等得最久的桌离服务员有多远。"
msgstr "Guests have chosen dishes and are waiting to order. Select Locate in Tavern to see how far the busiest tables are from your servers."

msgid "等餐主要卡在出餐口之前。点「在餐厅定位」，检查交单、灶台和厨师搬餐的路线。"
msgstr "Most of the wait happens before the pass. Use Locate in Tavern to check order drop-off, stoves, and the cooks' route."

msgid "餐已经到了出餐口，客人还在等。点「在餐厅定位」，检查服务员取餐到客桌的路。"
msgstr "Food is at the pass but guests are still waiting. Use Locate in Tavern to check the servers' route from the pass to the tables."

msgid "有人因为队伍满员或等到午夜而没能入座。点「在餐厅定位」看入口，左栏还会单独统计缺匹配餐桌的客人。"
msgstr "Some guests found no space in the queue or waited until midnight. Locate in Tavern shows the entrance. The left column also counts guests without matching tables."

msgid "左边看客人的去向，右边找经营卡在哪一步。调整布局后，可以对照下一份日报。"
msgstr "The left side shows what happened to guests. The right side shows bottlenecks. Compare with tomorrow's report after a layout change."

msgid "老板，我是跑堂的阿禾。开店后，厨师和服务员会自己接单上菜。我先带你认两个柜台，再看看怎么合桌。"
msgstr "Boss, I'm He, your server. When we open, the cooks and servers handle orders automatically. I'll show you the two counters, then how to combine tables."

msgid "跟你看看"
msgstr "Show me"

msgid "我自己逛"
msgstr "I'll look around"

msgid "这是出餐口。厨师把做好的菜放在这里，服务员再取餐送到客桌。"
msgstr "This is the pass. Cooks put finished dishes here, and servers carry them to the tables."

msgid "记住了"
msgstr "Got it"

msgid "这是订单口。服务员给客人点单后，会把订单送到这里，厨师从这里接单。"
msgstr "This is the order counter. Servers drop off orders here for the cooks."

msgid "再看出餐口"
msgstr "Show the pass again"

msgid "跳过引导"
msgstr "Skip tutorial"

msgid "今天的菜单上有%s，一锅出%d份。准备好了就点下方「开店」，我会带你看第一桌怎么点餐。"
msgstr "Today's menu: %s, %d servings per batch. When you're ready, open the tavern and I'll show you how the first table orders."

msgid "\n合成需要留出桌面和走道。"
msgstr "\nLeave room for the table and an aisle."

msgid "右边"
msgstr "right"

msgid "左边"
msgstr "left"

msgid "下方"
msgstr "bottom"

msgid "上方"
msgstr "top"

msgid "同一组客人只坐人数相同的桌。用左键按住%s高亮的%s，等它抬起后拖到另一张高亮桌上，再松手。"
msgstr "Parties need a matching table. Hold the highlighted %s %s until it lifts, drag it onto the other table, then release."

msgid "稍后再试"
msgstr "Try later"

msgid "两张双人桌还能合成 2×2 的四人桌。"
msgstr "Two double tables can also form a 2×2 four-seat table."

msgid "四人桌只接待四人组，记得保留单人桌和双人桌。"
msgstr "Four-seat tables serve parties of four. Keep some singles and doubles."

msgid "合成成功。%s\n%s。选中多人桌后可用右下角的拆分图标或按 %s。"
msgstr "Tables combined. %s\n%s. Select the table and use Split or press %s."

msgid "继续"
msgstr "Continue"

msgid "高亮这桌已经选好菜，正等服务员过去点单。点「查看客人」能看他选了什么，我先把营业计时停住。"
msgstr "The highlighted table has chosen a dish and is waiting to order. Select View Guest to see their choice. I'll pause service for now."

msgid "查看客人"
msgstr "View guest"

msgid "看正在端盘的服务员。他刚从出餐口取到菜，接下来会送到点这道菜的客桌。"
msgstr "Watch the server with the plate. They've picked up the food at the pass and will take it to the table that ordered it."

msgid "第一笔饭钱到账了。顶栏的「今日营收」记录今天赚了多少，金币是现在能花的余额。想暂停观察，可以按 %s。"
msgstr "Our first payment is in. Today's Revenue shows what we've earned. Gold is what we can spend. Press %s to pause and look around."

msgid "右侧信息框显示客人的状态和菜名。等餐时，这里还会显示剩余耐心。看完再继续营业。"
msgstr "The right panel shows what the guest is doing and their dish. While they wait, you'll also see how much patience is left. Resume when ready."

msgid "顶栏左边是下次房租。今天营业结束会扣 %d 金币，采购前记得留足。"
msgstr "Next rent is at the top left. You'll pay %d gold after service today. Keep enough before buying supplies."

msgid "右上角红色的「重大事件」亮了。开店前点开「%s」，看看哪几天生效、客流怎么变。有奖励时，记得点公告底部领取。"
msgstr "The red Major Event button is lit. Open %s before service for dates and traffic changes, and claim the reward at the bottom if there is one."

msgid "查看公告"
msgstr "View announcement"

msgid "稍后查看"
msgstr "Check later"

msgid "这回咱们赶集。拼盘小食一锅四份，桌子翻得也快。开门时一起看看第一波客人。"
msgstr "Today's market day. Snacks come in batches of four and tables turn faster. Let's see who arrives first."

msgid "点收银台，再选「招聘与改造」。桌位和员工都要花声望与金币。招聘与改造页会列出两种价格和下次房租，手头的钱也得留一份给房东。"
msgstr "Select the cash register and choose Hiring & Upgrades. Extra tables and staff cost reputation and gold. Check both prices and set aside the next rent."

msgid "花 %d 颗闪星打开采购小厅。采购处每晚到货菜谱和增益。"
msgstr "Spend %d stars to open the supply hall. The stall gets recipes and boosts each night."

msgid "花 %d 颗闪星开放装饰商店。装饰放下后，会为范围内的餐桌、员工或灶台提供效果。"
msgstr "Spend %d stars to open the decor shop. Place an item to affect nearby tables, staff, or stoves."

msgid "花 %d 颗闪星扩开厨房，就多一口灶，也多一位厨师。"
msgstr "Spend %d stars to expand the kitchen and add a stove and a cook."

msgid "花 %d 颗闪星可开放奖杯展廊和旁边的奖杯商店，还会送一座铜摆钟。"
msgstr "Spend %d stars to open the trophy gallery and shop. A brass pendulum clock comes with it."

msgid "东边一开就多四张桌，花 %d 颗闪星。门口没坐上的客人，这回有地方请了。"
msgstr "Open the east wing for %d stars and gain four tables. That's more room for guests waiting at the door."

msgid "南边还能添三张桌，花 %d 颗闪星。这回你来掌眼，端到最远那桌得走多远？"
msgstr "The south wing adds three tables for %d stars. Can you spot the quickest route to the farthest one?"

msgid "%s需要 %d 颗闪星。"
msgstr "%s costs %d stars."

msgid " 还差 %d 颗，攒够了再来。"
msgstr " You need %d more."

msgid "奖杯商店开门了，就在展廊里。用闪星买奖杯，点右下角的背包图标取出。放到展廊里亮起的格子后，奖杯就会生效。"
msgstr "The trophy shop in the gallery is open. Buy trophies with stars and take them from the bag at the bottom right. Place them on lit gallery tiles to activate them."

msgid "查看奖杯商店"
msgstr "View trophy shop"

msgid "稍后再看"
msgstr "Look later"

msgid "采购小厅开门了。今晚可以用金币买新菜谱和营业增益。"
msgstr "The supply hall is open. Visit tonight to buy recipes and service boosts with gold."

msgid "装饰商店开门了。买到的装饰在建造背包里，摆放时会亮出效果范围。"
msgstr "The decor shop is open. Purchases go into build inventory. Their range lights up during placement."

msgid "查看采购处"
msgstr "View supply stall"

msgid "查看装饰商店"
msgstr "View decor shop"

msgid "点右侧「进入采购」。买到的菜谱会永久进收藏，增益只在标明的营业日内生效。"
msgstr "Select Browse Supplies on the right. Recipes stay in your collection. Boosts last for the stated number of service days."

msgid "点击餐厅里的空格放置新设施，给座位和柜台留出通路。暂时不用的设施，可以在右下角「建造」背包里找回。"
msgstr "Place new facilities on empty tiles and leave paths to seats and counters. You can recover stored items from Build at the bottom right."

msgid "在下方选物件，再到地图上放置。选中场景里的设施时，可以用右下角的图标移动、旋转或收起。"
msgstr "Select an item below and place it on the map. Select an existing facility to move, rotate, or store it with the controls at the bottom right."

msgid "夜晚点右下角的锤子，或按 %s 打开底部建造目录。按类别找物件，选中后点地图放置。隔墙可以拖成一排。按 Esc 取消当前操作，再按 Esc 关闭目录。"
msgstr "At night, select the hammer or press %s to open Build. Choose an item, then place it on the map. Drag a row to place partitions. Esc cancels the action, then closes Build."

msgid "%d 人组从第 %d 天来店"
msgstr "Parties of %d arrive from Day %d"

msgid "合桌与客人组"
msgstr "Tables & parties"

msgid "。客人组只坐人数相同的桌，店里没有对应的桌就会离开。\n选中多人桌后，点右下角的拆分图标或按 %s，可以逐级拆回。"
msgstr ". Parties need tables of the matching size and leave if none are available.\nSelect a combined table and use Split or press %s to split it."

msgid "重大事件"
msgstr "Major event"

msgid "奖杯商店"
msgstr "Trophy shop"

msgid "解锁右上角的奖杯展廊后，点外墙上的奖杯商店。用闪星购买，摆进展廊后生效。"
msgstr "Unlock the trophy gallery at the top right, then select the shop on the outer wall. Buy trophies with stars and display them to activate their effects."

msgid "建造和布置"
msgstr "Building & layout"

msgid "\n选中设施后，右下角会显示可用工具。把鼠标停在图标上可查看名称。也可以按 %s 旋转。"
msgstr "\nSelect a facility for tools at the bottom right. Hover over an icon for its name. You can also press %s to rotate."

msgid "营业与复盘"
msgstr "Service & reports"

msgid "服务员点单后送到订单口，厨师做好后放到出餐口，服务员再取餐上桌。\n"
msgstr "Servers bring orders to the order counter. Cooks take finished dishes to the pass. Servers pick them up and deliver them to the table.\n"

msgid "\n日报的「在餐厅定位」会标出瓶颈。缺匹配餐桌时，先按客组人数调整桌型。"
msgstr "\nLocate in Tavern highlights bottlenecks. If guests can't find a table, adjust table sizes for their parties."

msgid "零拒客、等餐无扣分也无超时、午夜前完餐人数比例达标。三个目标各值一颗闪星。"
msgstr "Refuse no guests, avoid waiting penalties and timeouts, and meet the target for meals finished before midnight. Each goal earns one star."

msgid "看「明日预告」里的客流高峰，确认哪段时间会集中来客。开店前，左上角也会显示时段。"
msgstr "Check Tomorrow's Forecast for rush hour. The times also appear at the top left before opening."

msgid "待点单"
msgstr "Waiting to order"

msgid "查看等待最久的桌位，检查它们与服务员往返订单口的路线。"
msgstr "Check the tables with the longest wait and the servers' route to the order counter."

msgid "到出餐口前"
msgstr "Before the pass"

msgid "等餐主要发生在餐品到达出餐口之前。先看送单、灶台和厨师搬运。"
msgstr "Most of the wait is before food reaches the pass. Check order delivery, stoves, and cooks' carrying routes."

msgid "出餐口到客桌"
msgstr "Pass to table"

msgid "等餐主要发生在餐品到达出餐口之后。先看取餐和送到客桌的路线。"
msgstr "Most of the wait is after food reaches the pass. Check pickup and routes to the tables."

msgid "排队未入座率"
msgstr "Queue left without seating"

msgid "这批客人未能入座。查看入口队列，检查餐桌是否周转得过来。"
msgstr "These guests never got a seat. Check the entrance queue and how quickly tables free up."

