msgid "第 %d 天来一人，第 %d 天来两人。记得留出双人桌。"
msgstr "One guest on Day %d and two on Day %d. Keep a two-seat table ready."

msgid "地痞会一直等到上菜，每人每轮等餐扣 %d 声望。"
msgstr "Ruffians wait until served and cost %d reputation per guest per round."

msgid "%d 位安全员同桌用餐，用餐时长为平时的 %d 倍。"
msgstr "%d inspectors dine together for %d times the usual duration."

msgid "全组餐点平均品质 %d%% 时声望持平。100%% 品质扣 %d 声望，超出标准有奖励。"
msgstr "Average quality of %d%% breaks even. 100%% quality costs %d reputation. Higher quality earns a bonus."

msgid "未上齐的餐点会拉低检查结果。"
msgstr "Missing dishes lower the inspection result."

